---
layout: base.njk
title: Journal
description: Shorter, more frequent writing from Yourville — trends, opinions, and practical notes on small-town life.
permalink: /journal/
---
<div class="article-header">
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Journal</h1>
    <p class="article-meta">Shorter and more frequent than the guides. <a href="/journal/feed.xml">Subscribe via RSS</a>.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<section>
  <div class="container">
    {% for post in collections.journal %}
    <div class="journal-item">
      <time>{{ post.data.date | readableDate }}</time>
      <h3><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h3>
      <p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
